<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8 col-12">
      <div class="card p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 border shadow-sm bg-white">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: November 2026</p>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">1. Information We Collect</h5>
          <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
            At Wanderlust, we prioritize the protection and security of your personal data. We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, publishing a property listing, writing reviews, or making a reservation. This includes your name, email address, phone number, and stay preferences.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
          <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
            We use the information we collect to facilitate reservations, communicate with hosts and guests, maintain platform security, prevent unauthorized activities, and improve our services and user experience.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">3. Information Sharing & Disclosure</h5>
          <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
            When a booking is confirmed, necessary details such as guest name, stay duration, and contact information are shared between the guest and host to ensure a seamless check-in experience. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">4. Security Measures</h5>
          <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
            We implement industry-standard encryption, secure session management, and server-side authentication protocols to safeguard your account and transaction data against unauthorized access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-top pt-3">
          <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-dark rounded-pill px-4">Back to Explore</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

